  "description": "<p data-end=\"536\" data-start=\"221\"><strong data-end=\"246\" data-start=\"221\">&bull; Brand introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"249\" data-start=\"246\">ACNEA is a science-driven skincare brand built on a legacy of real results. Born from decades of clinical skincare experience, ACNEA blends innovation with simplicity &mdash; offering high-performance products designed for busy lives and beautiful skin. Our mission: smart skincare, zero fuss.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"538\"><strong data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"538\">&bull; Product description:</strong><br data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"564\">The ACNEA Box is our signature subscription offering, available in two tiers:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"646\">\r\n<li data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"646\">\r\n<p data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"648\"><strong data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"648\">ACNEA Standard Box</strong> &ndash; Includes our best-selling cleanser and spot cream, designed to simplify acne care without compromising effectiveness. ($69/month)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"805\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"807\"><strong data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"807\">ACNEA VIP Box</strong> &ndash; A premium skincare and self-care experience that includes the cleanser, spot cream, and a rotating selection of luxurious, surprise add-ons like skincare tools, lifestyle goods, and exclusive limited-edition items. ($99/month)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1153\" data-start=\"1055\">Each box delivers effortless, effective skincare directly to your door &mdash; no clutter, no guesswork.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1155\"><strong data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1155\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1189\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1189\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1191\">Backed by 40+ years of acne treatment expertise</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1241\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1243\">Gender-neutral, minimalist branding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1281\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1283\">Results-driven formulations that blend science with luxury</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1344\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1346\">Exclusive VIP tier surprises for elevated unboxing experiences</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1475\" data-start=\"1411\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1475\" data-start=\"1413\">Designed for real routines &mdash; quick, effective, and feel-good</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1476\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1478\">Subscribers get birthday perks and limited-edition box drops</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1655\" data-start=\"1540\"><strong data-end=\"1560\" data-start=\"1540\">&bull; Payment terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1560\">Affiliates earn&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1606\" data-start=\"1579\">20% commission per sale</strong>&nbsp;through tracked referral links or promo codes.</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1870\" data-start=\"1656\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1656\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1658\"><strong data-end=\"1679\" data-start=\"1658\">Payout frequency:</strong>&nbsp;Monthly</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1785\" data-start=\"1690\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1785\" data-start=\"1692\"><strong data-end=\"1712\" data-start=\"1692\">Cookie duration:</strong>&nbsp;60 days &mdash; earn on every box ordered within two months of your referral</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1870\" data-start=\"1786\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1870\" data-start=\"1788\"><strong data-end=\"1830\" data-start=\"1788\">Bonus tiers and performance incentives</strong>&nbsp;available for top-performing affiliates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1898\" data-start=\"1872\"><strong data-end=\"1896\" data-start=\"1872\">&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2282\" dat